# Built packages. The repository holds the sources they are built from; keeping
# the zips as well doubles the size and invites editing the wrong copy.
*.zip

# Spare copies made while working. If one of them ever matters it should be a
# commit, not a file named "— копия".
*— копия*
*- копия*
*.bak
*.orig
*.removed-in-*

# Notes and captures from debugging sessions.
*.log
*.diff
*.mp4
/.agents/.compact-state
